1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,000
你只是把手机拿起来，
You just pick up your phone,

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,150
屏幕就跳进了购物App。
and it jumps into a shopping app.

3
00:00:04,150 --> 00:00:04,990
罪魁祸首：
The culprit:

4
00:00:04,990 --> 00:00:06,130
摇一摇广告。
shake-to-open ads.

5
00:00:06,130 --> 00:00:08,280
而且常常是你根本没想摇，
And often you never meant to shake it.

6
00:00:08,280 --> 00:00:09,300
它就跳了。
It jumps anyway.

7
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:10,640
这回苹果出手了：
Now Apple steps in:

8
00:00:10,640 --> 00:00:14,790
iOS 27.2测试版里，多了一个国行专属开关。
a China-only switch in the iOS 27.2 beta.

9
00:00:14,790 --> 00:00:16,130
在运动与健身里，
Under Motion & Fitness,

10
00:00:16,130 --> 00:00:18,930
可以不让某个App读运动传感器。
you can block an app from the motion sensors.

11
00:00:18,930 --> 00:00:20,340
今天的烧脑问题：
Today's brain-teaser:

12
00:00:20,340 --> 00:00:22,580
手机凭什么知道你在摇它？
how does a phone know you shook it?

13
00:00:22,580 --> 00:00:25,820
答案藏在一个你天天都在用的物理定律里：
The answer hides in a law of physics you use every day:

14
00:00:25,820 --> 00:00:26,450
惯性。
inertia.

15
00:00:26,450 --> 00:00:29,440
手机里藏着一杆比芝麻还小的弹簧秤，
Inside hides a spring scale smaller than a sesame seed:

16
00:00:29,440 --> 00:00:30,610
叫加速度计。
the accelerometer.

17
00:00:30,610 --> 00:00:32,400
一小块硅做的质量块，
A tiny block of silicon

18
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:34,670
挂在几根细细的硅弹簧上。
hangs on thin silicon springs.

19
00:00:34,670 --> 00:00:36,010
手机往右一冲，
The phone jerks right;

20
00:00:36,010 --> 00:00:38,630
质量块因为惯性，往左一躲。
inertia makes the block lag to the left.

21
00:00:38,630 --> 00:00:40,250
就像公交车一起步，
Like when a bus pulls away

22
00:00:40,250 --> 00:00:41,630
你会往后一仰。
and you lean back.

23
00:00:41,630 --> 00:00:44,140
质量块旁边有一排梳子一样的电极，
Comb-shaped electrodes sit beside it.

24
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:45,820
它一躲，缝隙就变了。
When it moves, the gaps change.

25
00:00:45,820 --> 00:00:47,660
缝隙一变，电容就变，
Gaps change, capacitance changes,

26
00:00:47,660 --> 00:00:49,990
芯片就算出：加速了多少。
and the chip computes the acceleration.

27
00:00:49,990 --> 00:00:51,690
没有齿轮，没有线圈，
No gears, no coils.

28
00:00:51,690 --> 00:00:53,690
全是在硅片上刻出来的。
It's all carved into a silicon chip.

29
00:00:53,690 --> 00:00:54,370
反转一：
Twist one:

30
00:00:54,370 --> 00:00:56,520
你一动不动，它也有读数。
even sitting still, it reads something.

31
00:00:56,520 --> 00:00:58,880
读多少？每秒平方9.8米，
9.8 meters per second squared:

32
00:00:58,880 --> 00:01:00,450
那是地球在拽它。
that's Earth pulling on it.

33
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:02,440
所以手机知道哪边是下，
So the phone knows which way is down,

34
00:01:02,440 --> 00:01:04,910
你一横过来，屏幕就跟着转。
and the screen turns when you do.

35
00:01:04,910 --> 00:01:06,020
计步也靠它：
Your step counter uses it too:

36
00:01:06,020 --> 00:01:08,730
你每走一步，质量块就晃一下。
every step jiggles the block.

37
00:01:08,730 --> 00:01:10,090
可光有加速度，
But acceleration alone

38
00:01:10,090 --> 00:01:12,720
分不清你是在摇，还是在转。
can't tell a shake from a turn.

39
00:01:12,720 --> 00:01:14,630
所以还有第二个小家伙：
So there's a second little guy:

40
00:01:14,630 --> 00:01:15,440
陀螺仪。
the gyroscope.

41
00:01:15,440 --> 00:01:17,770
里面的小质量块一直来回振动，
Its tiny block vibrates back and forth nonstop.

42
00:01:17,770 --> 00:01:20,380
手机一转，它就被往旁边推一把。
Turn the phone, and it gets pushed sideways.

43
00:01:20,380 --> 00:01:22,070
这一推叫科里奥利力，
That push is the Coriolis force.

44
00:01:22,070 --> 00:01:24,220
推得越狠，说明转得越快。
The harder the push, the faster the turn.

45
00:01:24,220 --> 00:01:27,190
加速度计管往哪冲，陀螺仪管怎么转，
The accelerometer feels pushes, the gyroscope feels turns.

46
00:01:27,190 --> 00:01:30,110
两个一起，手机就知道自己在干嘛。
Together, the phone knows what it's doing.

47
00:01:30,110 --> 00:01:31,670
那多大才算“摇”？
So how hard counts as a shake?

48
00:01:31,670 --> 00:01:34,570
2022年，一个行业标准给了数。
A 2022 industry standard set numbers.

49
00:01:34,570 --> 00:01:37,090
加速度至少每秒平方15米，
At least 15 meters per second squared,

50
00:01:37,090 --> 00:01:40,110
转过至少35度，或者摇满3秒。
at least 35 degrees of turn, or 3 seconds of shaking.

51
00:01:40,110 --> 00:01:42,330
15，大约是一点五倍重力，
15 is about one and a half g.

52
00:01:42,330 --> 00:01:44,160
正常拿手机，碰不到。
Normal handling shouldn't reach it.

53
00:01:44,160 --> 00:01:44,960
粗略估算，
As a rough estimate,

54
00:01:44,960 --> 00:01:47,020
差不多是使劲甩一下手腕。
that's about a hard flick of the wrist.

55
00:01:47,020 --> 00:01:47,710
反转二：
Twist two:

56
00:01:47,710 --> 00:01:50,780
这只是团体标准，自愿执行，不强制。
it's a voluntary standard. Nothing forces it.

57
00:01:50,780 --> 00:01:53,490
2023年，工信部就点过名：
In 2023, China's tech ministry called out

58
00:01:53,490 --> 00:01:55,940
有的摇一摇，灵敏得过头。
shake prompts that were far too sensitive.

59
00:01:55,940 --> 00:01:57,760
门槛一调低，走路一颠、
Set the bar too low, and a step

60
00:01:57,760 --> 00:02:00,360
坐车一晃，都可能被当成“摇”。
or a bumpy ride might count as a shake.

61
00:02:00,360 --> 00:02:02,710
而且苹果的审核规则本来就不许
And Apple's own rules already forbid

62
00:02:02,710 --> 00:02:05,190
拿陀螺仪这类硬件功能来变现。
making money off hardware like the gyroscope.

63
00:02:05,190 --> 00:02:06,230
所以这个开关，
So this switch

64
00:02:06,230 --> 00:02:08,270
等于拔掉了广告的“耳朵”。
basically unplugs the ad's ears.

65
00:02:08,270 --> 00:02:10,060
反转三，最妙的一个：
Twist three, the best one:

66
00:02:10,060 --> 00:02:13,030
这套传感器，正是机器人的平衡感。
these sensors are a robot's sense of balance.

67
00:02:13,030 --> 00:02:15,560
人形机器人、无人机、平衡车，
Humanoid robots, drones, self-balancing scooters

68
00:02:15,560 --> 00:02:17,660
都靠它知道自己歪没歪。
all use them to know if they're tilting.

69
00:02:17,660 --> 00:02:19,260
一秒读几百上千次，
Hundreds to thousands of readings a second,

70
00:02:19,260 --> 00:02:20,980
一歪就马上掰回来。
correcting every wobble.

71
00:02:20,980 --> 00:02:22,050
你的手机里，
Inside your phone

72
00:02:22,050 --> 00:02:24,120
住着一个机器人的小脑。
lives a robot's sense of balance.

73
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:25,960
没有它，机器人站不住，
Without it, robots can't stand,

74
00:02:25,960 --> 00:02:27,430
无人机也飞不稳。
and drones can't fly steady.

75
00:02:27,430 --> 00:02:30,190
友情提示：这个开关还在测试版里，
Friendly fine print: this switch is still in beta.

76
00:02:30,190 --> 00:02:33,080
叫什么、放哪儿，正式版都可能变。
Its name and place may change.

77
00:02:33,080 --> 00:02:33,840
关掉以后，
Block an app,

78
00:02:33,840 --> 00:02:35,630
个别App可能会闪退。
and it may crash.

79
00:02:35,630 --> 00:02:38,460
安卓的小米、华为、vivo、OPPO，
Android makers like Xiaomi, Huawei, vivo and OPPO

80
00:02:38,460 --> 00:02:40,210
早就有类似的权限开关。
already have similar switches.

81
00:02:40,210 --> 00:02:41,570
手机知道你在摇，
Your phone knows you shook it

82
00:02:41,570 --> 00:02:44,080
是因为里面有一杆会晃的小秤。
because a tiny scale inside wobbled.

83
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:45,770
下次再被摇进广告，
So next time an ad ambushes you,

84
00:02:45,770 --> 00:02:47,620
别怪手，怪惯性。
don't blame your hand. Blame inertia.

